{
  "//": "The STANDING fleet — tracked so it reproduces on any machine. `cargo xtask fleet up` seeds the machine-local runtime registry (.claude/fleet/registry.json) from this, creating each agent's worktree off trunk and its tmux window. Ephemeral agents (per-issue `fix`, on-demand `design`) are NOT here — they are minted at runtime by the PM / concierge. Edit this file to change the standing fleet; `fleet up` reconciles.",
